Regicide 0.6.2
regicide [moves|inspect] [--fen "six-field FEN"] [--play e2e4 e7e5 ...]
regicide [perft|divide] DEPTH [--fen "FEN"] [--play ...]
regicide search [DEPTH=4] [--nodes N] [--movetime MS] [--fen "FEN"] [--play ...]
  optional search flags: --no-position --no-quiescence --no-tt --hash MiB --no-fast-moves
    --no-quiet-ordering --no-quiescence-checks --no-see --no-pawn-shield --no-pawn-structure --no-lmr
    --eval-file MODEL (experimental neural evaluation; default remains classical)
regicide eval --eval-file MODEL [--fen "FEN"] [--play ...] (static cp only)
    optional eval flags: --no-pawn-shield --no-pawn-structure
regicide uci  (UCI engine protocol)
regicide batch  (stdin: FEN|moves; stdout: tab-separated state)
